  "messages": [
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1781172600,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "这匹缎赏给你。前日替你牵马的也在讨赏，你分他半匹？",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-1-1"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1781172655,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "先问那天一共有几个牵马的。若说为那一程给赏，就人人照路程领。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-1-2"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1781172710,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "他会来开口，别人不会。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-1-3"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1781172765,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "所以更不能只赏他。我这匹裁开，按每个人走的里数分。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-1-4"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1783332600,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "两户都少交三斛。老赵给我赶过车，先宽了他。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-2-1"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1783332655,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "老赵的仓还满，河边那户的稻子是真淹了。我去过。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-2-2"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1783332710,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "你要替陌生人说话？",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-2-3"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1783332765,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "我看的是还能拿出多少粮。谁真遭了灾谁缓，明年换作老赵，我也这样算。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-2-4"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1786183800,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "晚宴留个好位子给你，坐我旁边。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-3-1"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1786183855,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "把那儿给魏续吧。昨日我当众疑他丢了印，翻出来却在我自己囊里。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-3-2"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1786183910,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "赏他点钱就是。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-3-3"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1786183965,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "我是在众人面前冤他。让他坐上来，我当面赔个不是，他才不用低着头回去。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-3-4"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1787652600,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "木车行的人是我旧识，今晚押送军印，用他的车。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-4-1"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1787652655,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "军印失了算我的。把两辆车的封扣、锁眼都列给我。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-4-2"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1787652710,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "两家价钱一样。你就不能给我个面子？",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-4-3"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1787652765,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "价钱一样，就看路上能不能不留痕地打开。哪辆过得了这一关我用哪辆，换谁荐的也一样。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-4-4"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1790331000,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "今晚散得早。你要往哪里去？",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-5-1"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1790331055,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "去场上找两个还没睡的说说话。一个人坐回房里，那几句冷话又得想半宿。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-5-2"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1790331110,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "又要找人比武？",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-5-3"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1790331165,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "今天不比。我想听听营里别的事，换换心思。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-5-4"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1792836600,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "降书写得漂亮。对方的使者和你是旧友，你来担保？",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-6-1"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1792836655,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "他曾救过我，我肯拿自己的马谢他。城门的事要另算。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-6-2"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-dongzhuo",
      "accountName": "董卓",
      "timestamp": 1792836710,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "他一定要今晚先入城。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-6-3"
    },
    {
      "sender": "whomi-fiction-lvbu",
      "accountName": "吕布",
      "timestamp": 1792836765,
      "type": 0,
      "content": "谁递降书都一样，先交兵符再开门。他是我朋友也不能少这一道。",
      "platformMessageId": "whomi-lvbu-v2-dongzhuo-6-4"
    }
  ]
